Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.29,0:00:04.00,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1906.667,366.667)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果\N使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！\N翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:05.55,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,all right guys hello everyone I have a little PSA for all of you Windows users
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:11.76,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and especially those who use the hibernation feature actively like me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:18.48,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I used to be a hater of hibernation and used to shut down my laptop all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:23.59,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,once I switched from shutting down to hibernation a huge problem arose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.53,0:00:29.49,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,the laptop started turning on on its own at like 3:00 a.m or something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:36.63,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,so apparently Windows actually decides when or when not to turn on your computer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:38.54,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,when it's hibernated
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:44.30,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and that setting is enabled by default and you have to change it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:46.61,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,inside the legacy control panel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:48.27,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it's very treacherous
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:49.62,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,so you have to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:55.59,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,you have to open the legacy control panel inside of here you've got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:00.10,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,power options as you can see power options
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:06.53,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,open that and then you've got
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:11.81,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,you got to select your plan in my case it's balanced might be anything else for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:16.01,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and you might want to change multiple plans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:20.31,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,if your computer your device uses multiple plans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:25.31,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,then you have to open advanced power settings right here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:28.67,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,you get a power options window
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:32.75,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and in this window you have to select sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:36.47,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and then allow wake timers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.31,0:01:42.26,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,there is that setting that turns your device on randomly at night
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:45.33,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and then you have to disable
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.38,0:01:49.18,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,you have to disable it completely
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:53.98,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it will be enabled for you by default because Windows is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:57.46,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,Windows doesn't care about what you think
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:01.94,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,so then you hit apply and that's pretty much it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:06.69,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah that's the only power plan I've got on my computer here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:13.36,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,might be different for you you have to disable it on every case right here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:15.72,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,under allow wake timers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:19.45,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,so the main problem with that feature
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.48,0:02:25.00,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,is that first of all my laptop is pretty loud it's a gaming laptop you see it's an MSI Vector
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:30.78,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,but more importantly since it's a gaming laptop it heats up and every time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:35.25,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it starts up the fans start spinning a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:42.15,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and if the air is hot it can even damage the LCD on the laptop
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:44.87,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,and I think it's damaged already
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:50.05,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm not sure whether it's because I use hibernation or it's just natural
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:51.85,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,wear and tear of the laptop
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:56.68,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean if you if you just look at the screen it's kind of it's kind of damaged
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:01.58,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,if you take a decent look here see the line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:07.37,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,that's the damage the hot air causes to the LCD
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:11.95,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,so you definitely have to turn this Windows feature off because it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:13.72,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,it might damage your computer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:18.69,Enderman-EN,,0,0,0,,thanks for watching take care
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:05.55,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,大家好，我有个小提醒要给所有Windows用户
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:11.76,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,尤其是像我这样经常使用休眠功能的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:18.48,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我曾是个讨厌休眠功能的人，过去总是直接关机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:23.59,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,一旦我从关机切换到了休眠模式，一个巨大的问题就出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.53,0:00:29.49,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,笔记本在凌晨3点左右突然自己开机了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:36.63,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,显然，Windows实际上会决定何时开启或关闭你的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:38.54,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,当它处于休眠状态时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:44.30,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,该设置默认处于启用状态，必须手动更改
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:46.61,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,在旧版控制面板内
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:48.27,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这非常阴险
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:49.62,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,所以你要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:55.59,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,在这里面打开旧版控制面板
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:00.10,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,找到电源选项
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:06.53,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,打开你会看到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:11.81,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你选的计划，在我这里是“平衡”，对你来说可能是其他方案
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:16.01,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你可能需要更改多个计划
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:20.31,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你的电脑或设备使用多个计划
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:25.31,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你必须在这里打开“更改高级电源设置”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.68,0:01:28.67,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,你会看到电源选项窗口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:32.75,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,在这个窗口中，你要选择“睡眠”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:36.47,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,然后找到“允许使用唤醒定时器”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.31,0:01:42.26,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,有个设置会让你的设备在夜间随机开机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:45.33,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这里要禁用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.38,0:01:49.18,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,要彻底禁用才行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:53.98,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这个默认启用，因为Windows
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:57.46,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,才不在乎你怎么想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:01.94,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,然后点击“应用”，基本上就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:06.69,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是我电脑上唯一的电源计划了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:13.36,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,对你来说可能有所不同，你得在每个计划中的这里禁用它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:15.72,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,在“允许使用唤醒定时器”里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:19.45,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这个功能的主要问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.48,0:02:25.00,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,首先，我的笔记本电脑声音很大，这是一台游戏本，微星Vector
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:30.78,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,但更重要的是，作为一款游戏笔记本电脑，它会发热，而且每次都会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:35.25,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这会让风扇狂转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:42.15,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,如果空气过热，甚至可能损坏笔记本电脑上的液晶显示屏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:44.87,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,而且我觉得它已经坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:50.05,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,但我不确定是因为我使用了休眠模式，还是这本来就是自然现象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:51.85,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,笔记本电脑的磨损
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:56.68,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说如果你只是看屏幕的话 它有点损坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:01.58,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你仔细看看这里，就能看到那条线
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:07.37,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是热风对液晶显示屏造成的损害
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:11.95,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,所以你必须得关闭这个Windows功能，因为它
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:13.72,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,可能会损坏你的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:18.69,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,感谢观看，生活愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:12.31,Enderman-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fs75\fad(200,200)\pos(1914.667,212)}原标题：The Windows Feature that Might Damage your Laptop 原作者：Enderman  原视频上传日期：2025年4月23日
